  "title": "Easy Stroganoff",
  "description": "Whip up a warm and hearty stroganoff with ground beef, Worcestershire sauce, garlic and mushrooms in a rich sauce of milk, sour cream and cream of mushroom soup. Serve over hot egg noodles for a satisfying meal.",
  "authors": [
    "Penny Harvey"
  ],
